WEBVTT

01:42.644 --> 01:43.812
MITSUNARI TOKUGAWA

01:47.899 --> 01:48.733
RESILIENCE

01:48.817 --> 01:50.068
This is the critical juncture.

01:50.860 --> 01:52.821
Will you undergo treatment

01:53.488 --> 01:58.910
or will you allow the illness
to progress without resistance?

01:59.911 --> 02:03.331
This will be the final chance
to make that choice.

02:06.167 --> 02:09.129
You must make a choice, Mr. Tokugawa.

02:15.802 --> 02:17.595
It goes without saying,

02:18.179 --> 02:19.639
there is no choice.

02:20.140 --> 02:22.100
I walk the path of no regrets.

02:22.183 --> 02:25.979
There is no other path on which to walk.

02:26.062 --> 02:28.356
It is the same with you.

02:29.440 --> 02:31.025
Isn't it, Doctor?

02:47.333 --> 02:49.711
Chiharu Shiba?

02:50.628 --> 02:56.843
Baki Hanma,
don't say a thing and just fight me.

02:57.343 --> 02:59.262
What?

03:07.353 --> 03:11.191
Sorry this is so sudden, Baki.

03:11.774 --> 03:12.609
But why?

03:15.945 --> 03:19.282
Does there need to be a reason?

03:20.450 --> 03:22.785
Well, I mean...

03:24.871 --> 03:27.874
<i>This is unbelievably abrupt, Shiba.</i>

03:29.334 --> 03:30.793
<i>We've got no reason to fight.</i>

03:39.093 --> 03:41.721
Fight Baki.

03:42.513 --> 03:45.308
You want me to?

03:47.143 --> 03:50.396
Why would he fight someone like me?

03:52.774 --> 03:57.153
Chiharu Shiba, do you need a reason?

04:03.284 --> 04:07.247
Well, well, well...

04:08.790 --> 04:11.084
You're an extraordinary fighter,

04:11.167 --> 04:13.503
the world's strongest young man.

04:13.586 --> 04:15.463
Yet you're quite a softie.

04:16.297 --> 04:19.300
Chiharu, that was the last time

04:21.052 --> 04:26.307
that when you strike
I'll counterattack without hurting you.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.226
There won't be a next time.

04:29.060 --> 04:31.229
Who the fuck asked you

04:32.563 --> 04:34.315
to hold back?!

04:39.153 --> 04:40.113
<i>Man...</i>

04:40.196 --> 04:44.701
<i>He's freakin' strong.
He truly is the real deal.</i>

04:46.953 --> 04:52.125
<i>I really have no idea just how huge
the difference is between us.</i>

05:02.218 --> 05:06.222
<i>Chiharu Shiba... Why?</i>

05:06.806 --> 05:09.392
<i>How come you're fighting me now?</i>

05:14.731 --> 05:16.691
<i>Fight Baki.</i>

05:17.775 --> 05:19.902
Because you're perfectly suited for this.

05:28.494 --> 05:30.246
His nickname's "Smoking."

05:30.830 --> 05:32.707
He follows you like smoke.

05:33.333 --> 05:35.251
He coils around you like smoke.

05:35.752 --> 05:39.422
He has never once retreated
in past matches.

05:39.505 --> 05:42.175
He's the man closest
to obtaining the title.

05:45.762 --> 05:48.765
<i>Joe Cruiser, age 36.</i>

05:49.766 --> 05:51.851
He's your next opponent.

05:52.894 --> 05:55.813
He's an oldster.
He won't be any trouble at all.

05:57.023 --> 06:01.694
<i>After winning the Golden Gloves
as an amateur, he turned pro.</i>

06:02.403 --> 06:05.698
<i>He won some and lost some</i>

06:06.324 --> 06:09.994
<i>as he built his career
and climbed into the top ranks.</i>

06:11.412 --> 06:14.207
When he heard about the fight money,
he jumped at the chance.

06:14.707 --> 06:17.335
He's an attractive opponent
since he lacks talent.

06:17.418 --> 06:20.213
Feel free to announce that you'll KO him.

06:23.091 --> 06:25.093
So, that's what Kaiser said?

06:25.718 --> 06:28.596
That he's an attractive opponent
since he's got no talent.

06:29.639 --> 06:35.978
Golden Gloves winner and top-ranked pro
Joe Cruiser has no talent, huh?

06:38.689 --> 06:41.609
And you believed that?

06:42.318 --> 06:45.405
That's right. He has no talent.

06:45.488 --> 06:46.489
Hey!

06:47.824 --> 06:49.325
He has a good look.

06:51.160 --> 06:53.621
You don't mean that he's handsome, right?

06:53.704 --> 06:56.082
It's not a face
that can be created in a day.

06:57.834 --> 06:59.127
Meager skills.

07:00.253 --> 07:01.337
Short stature.

07:02.463 --> 07:05.633
Even so, he staunchly refuses
to give in to despair

07:06.259 --> 07:08.010
and has overcome deadly hurdles.

07:08.928 --> 07:12.098
His appearance alone conveys that.

07:13.099 --> 07:14.767
His career has not been ordinary.

07:17.895 --> 07:20.815
Actually, I'm a fan of his as well.

07:34.370 --> 07:38.583
When I was visiting China,
I heard rumors about you.

07:38.666 --> 07:40.543
You're famous.

07:41.294 --> 07:42.879
But I'm quite certain

07:43.880 --> 07:46.549
I'm not one-thousandth
as famous as you are.

07:49.844 --> 07:51.304
I've come here to stop you.

07:52.346 --> 07:54.390
You mean my fight with Joe Cruiser?

07:55.391 --> 08:02.231
It's not that I wouldn't like to see
kung fu given a real scare by boxing

08:03.399 --> 08:06.819
but I am friendly with the Hanma family.

08:07.862 --> 08:10.072
Are you saying I wouldn't win?

08:11.157 --> 08:13.075
What is his nickname?

08:14.035 --> 08:14.911
Smoking.

08:16.162 --> 08:19.499
Boxers have all kinds of nicknames.

08:19.582 --> 08:22.210
However, one thing is very clear.

08:22.877 --> 08:27.215
Boxers are always less
than their description.

08:28.257 --> 08:30.051
<i>It was the same with me.</i>

08:30.718 --> 08:31.594
<i>"Phantom."</i>

08:32.303 --> 08:34.555
<i>Though my punch
was said to be phantom-like,</i>

08:34.639 --> 08:37.391
<i>it could be seen clearly in slow motion.</i>

08:39.060 --> 08:40.978
But he's different.

08:43.064 --> 08:46.984
Smoking... Have you ever fought smoke?

08:47.735 --> 08:49.111
I have neglected to.

08:49.779 --> 08:51.739
Imagine this.

08:52.698 --> 08:54.534
<i>Smoke that attacks.</i>

08:55.201 --> 08:57.703
<i>The 4,000 years
of Chinese skill striking at it.</i>

08:58.371 --> 09:01.374
<i>Before long,
you'll be surrounded by the smoke.</i>

09:03.459 --> 09:06.254
Then you'll be punched for sure.

09:07.296 --> 09:11.634
<i>And most likely,
by the world's strongest left hook.</i>

09:14.470 --> 09:16.389
"I don't mind!"

09:17.431 --> 09:20.393
That's a favorite saying of yours,
isn't it?

09:21.686 --> 09:22.770
That may be so.

09:24.564 --> 09:25.773
Then?

09:26.399 --> 09:28.109
I don't mind in the least!

09:32.488 --> 09:33.573
<i>Why?</i>

09:33.656 --> 09:38.494
<i>Why do I feel intimidated
by this small heavyweight?</i>

09:39.161 --> 09:41.789
<i>He's 180 cm, 92 kilos.</i>

09:42.331 --> 09:46.043
<i>That size isn't anything special
even for Asians.</i>

09:47.086 --> 09:48.629
<i>Even so, there's something else.</i>

09:49.672 --> 09:51.299
<i>An overwhelming presence.</i>

09:51.882 --> 09:53.884
<i>His physical... No.</i>

09:54.552 --> 09:59.056
<i>The depth of his very character
is on a completely different level.</i>

09:59.932 --> 10:02.935
Retsu, how about it?
How does he look to you?

10:03.019 --> 10:05.187
Did he look big to you, or...

10:06.230 --> 10:10.151
He's 180 cm, 92 kilos.
Just like the data says.

10:11.027 --> 10:12.778
No larger, no smaller.

10:15.031 --> 10:17.074
An attractive opponent, huh?

10:18.117 --> 10:19.577
He couldn't be more so.

10:22.163 --> 10:27.710
Though a part of me would like to see
your brains get knocked out,

10:28.294 --> 10:31.714
I'd also like to thank you for giving me
the honor of being in the corner

10:31.797 --> 10:34.091
facing off against Smoking Joe.

10:35.926 --> 10:37.720
Make sure you come back alive!

10:44.894 --> 10:45.978
<i>What is this?</i>

10:47.021 --> 10:49.565
<i>What is with these punches?</i>

10:50.524 --> 10:51.359
<i>I can see them.</i>

10:52.360 --> 10:54.028
<i>I can see all his attacks.</i>

10:55.029 --> 10:56.947
<i>I'm defending against all his attacks.</i>

10:58.157 --> 10:59.367
<i>But still,</i>

11:00.076 --> 11:03.829
<i>deep in my body, deep in my organs,</i>

11:04.747 --> 11:06.207
<i>there's lingering damage!</i>

11:07.458 --> 11:09.502
<i>Inside those round,</i>

11:10.336 --> 11:14.048
<i>soft gloves that appear almost gentle...</i>

11:15.299 --> 11:19.679
<i>Inside those thick, limber muscles,</i>

11:20.846 --> 11:24.100
<i>It's as if there are sharp blades
hidden within them.</i>

11:27.478 --> 11:28.312
<i>I blundered...</i>

11:34.068 --> 11:35.986
<i>I'm certain it hit.</i>

11:37.446 --> 11:40.408
<i>A right punch. I felt the contact.</i>

11:41.242 --> 11:42.743
<i>He hit me at the same time.</i>

11:43.911 --> 11:45.830
<i>Probably with a left hook.</i>

11:47.623 --> 11:48.457
<i>Gloves...</i>

11:50.501 --> 11:51.794
<i>When I was in training</i>

11:52.628 --> 11:54.588
<i>I used them many times.</i>

11:56.006 --> 11:58.467
<i>But this weight and sharpness is a first.</i>

11:59.260 --> 12:03.848
<i>Though they lack the hardness
and the sharpness of bare fists,</i>

12:05.266 --> 12:07.643
<i>because of the extra weight of the gloves,</i>

12:08.352 --> 12:12.481
<i>the damage to the brain is clearly
far greater than with bare fists.</i>

12:14.150 --> 12:19.280
<i>It's as if my head is being shaken
by the hand of a giant.</i>

12:20.698 --> 12:25.035
<i>Even the damage from Baki's fists
didn't feel like this.</i>

12:26.370 --> 12:28.497
<i>Even Pickle's fists didn't feel like this.</i>

12:29.623 --> 12:32.460
<i>The gloves... Those things called gloves.</i>

12:33.210 --> 12:34.962
<i>Those tools called gloves...</i>

12:35.671 --> 12:37.590
<i>Tools...</i>

12:38.758 --> 12:41.218
<i>This... originality!</i>

12:46.974 --> 12:47.850
Retsu.

12:49.602 --> 12:50.436
Okay?

12:50.519 --> 12:53.230
<i>I see. That's what it is.</i>

12:53.939 --> 12:54.899
<i>These guys...</i>

12:54.982 --> 12:57.943
<i>The strength of the top-class boxers is...</i>

12:58.027 --> 12:58.861
Fight!

13:00.529 --> 13:05.367
<i>The fact that they're proficient
in the use of their tool, their gloves!</i>

13:06.577 --> 13:10.664
<i>Muscle tension is released
to underline the weight of the gloves.</i>

13:10.748 --> 13:11.749
<i>Then the liver shot.</i>

13:12.666 --> 13:14.376
<i>With the flicker jab as well,</i>

13:15.044 --> 13:16.879
<i>the glove is turned into a weapon.</i>

13:18.380 --> 13:19.298
<i>How incredible.</i>

13:20.341 --> 13:21.467
<i>I've just realized it!</i>

13:22.843 --> 13:24.970
<i>Boxing started with bare-knuckle fighting,</i>

13:25.846 --> 13:28.849
<i>but to transform it
into a safe and wholesome sport,</i>

13:30.142 --> 13:35.648
<i>in 1865, Queensberry's idea
for glove rules was incorporated.</i>

13:37.107 --> 13:39.819
<i>It's now been 150 years since then.</i>

13:42.112 --> 13:46.534
<i>After years of trial and error, at last,</i>

13:47.368 --> 13:49.537
<i>gloves were successfully
turned into weapons!</i>

13:52.331 --> 13:53.415
<i>I failed to see it.</i>

13:55.251 --> 13:57.628
<i>Due to their gentle, soft appearance,</i>

13:58.671 --> 14:00.631
<i>their tender feel,</i>

14:01.799 --> 14:05.719
<i>I had overlooked
the vicious will behind them.</i>

14:08.180 --> 14:10.891
<i>But what do I do about it?</i>

14:11.767 --> 14:15.396
<i>I've realized a lot of things, but</i>

14:16.981 --> 14:19.316
<i>the reality is that I'm taking damage!</i>

14:26.115 --> 14:27.700
Baki.

14:28.450 --> 14:32.955
Don't say a thing, and please fight me.

14:37.042 --> 14:38.460
Okay, I will.

14:39.837 --> 14:42.298
The hell I'm gonna do that, Chiharu.

14:43.048 --> 14:44.925
What the heck's gotten into you?

14:45.676 --> 14:50.222
Earlier, I just went with the flow
and fought, but it won't happen again.

14:51.557 --> 14:53.100
Does Baki Hanma need--

14:53.183 --> 14:58.022
Yeah, that's right. I need a reason.

14:58.731 --> 15:02.151
Come on, man,
why do you want to fight me so badly?

15:02.818 --> 15:05.112
Practice for brawls?

15:06.530 --> 15:09.575
Yeah, I guess you could call it practice.

15:09.658 --> 15:11.368
But it's practice for you.

15:11.952 --> 15:12.912
For me?

15:12.995 --> 15:14.955
That's right, for you.

15:15.956 --> 15:17.416
So, shall we begin?

15:17.499 --> 15:20.878
Whoa, hold on. Hold on there!

15:20.961 --> 15:23.380
That's not like you.

15:23.464 --> 15:26.425
Well, you ain't acting like anyone I know!

15:26.508 --> 15:28.385
Starting a fight as soon as we meet.

15:28.469 --> 15:30.638
From this point on...

15:30.721 --> 15:33.140
<i>He's gonna fight? Seriously?!</i>

15:34.475 --> 15:36.644
...we'll talk with our fists!

15:36.727 --> 15:39.355
<i>Yeah, this guy really is gonna fight.</i>

15:52.451 --> 15:57.790
Chiharu, I appreciate that you
volunteered to be my practice partner.

15:58.916 --> 16:01.043
But you're so damn weak, man.

16:02.044 --> 16:03.420
I won't fight you again.

16:04.171 --> 16:05.965
Get outta here when you wake up.

16:32.408 --> 16:36.120
<i>Holy shit. He hasn't given up at all.</i>

16:36.203 --> 16:37.830
<i>He's already getting ready.</i>

16:40.374 --> 16:41.834
<i>He's hopeless.</i>

16:41.917 --> 16:46.088
<i>With guys like that,
you've gotta really teach 'em a lesson.</i>

16:52.136 --> 16:54.847
<i>Oh, he's moving.</i>

16:54.930 --> 16:56.765
<i>He's moving toward the front door.</i>

16:56.849 --> 16:59.727
<i>I should hear him
putting on his shoes soon.</i>

16:59.810 --> 17:00.769
<i>He's here!</i>

17:02.730 --> 17:04.732
<i>What was that sound just now?</i>

17:05.357 --> 17:08.986
<i>That jerk didn't even bother
to put on his shoes properly!</i>

17:11.822 --> 17:16.076
<i>Doesn't he know the disadvantage of
wearing shoes with the backs crushed?`</i>

17:16.160 --> 17:18.245
<i>You've got only one-tenth of the power!</i>

17:20.205 --> 17:22.124
<i>You're such an idiot.</i>

17:25.502 --> 17:27.254
<i>That was awesome.</i>

17:27.337 --> 17:29.631
<i>That wasn't the punch of a novice.</i>

17:30.507 --> 17:32.384
Hey there.

17:32.968 --> 17:37.222
Apologies for wearing my shoes inside,
but we're in a fight.

17:39.725 --> 17:41.143
<i>He's also really strong.</i>

17:41.226 --> 17:44.897
I'll fix your front door later.

17:48.859 --> 17:51.153
<i>What the hell is this anyway?!</i>

17:54.740 --> 17:58.660
<i>He's a novice with no technique</i>

17:59.745 --> 18:00.746
<i>but he's got a lot...</i>

18:02.623 --> 18:07.669
<i>He's got a lot of fighting power,
enough to match his fighting spirit!</i>

18:08.796 --> 18:09.922
<i>This is...</i>

18:11.006 --> 18:14.301
<i>Put differently, this is</i>

18:15.677 --> 18:18.305
<i>his fighting spirit's own fighting power!</i>

18:22.267 --> 18:25.104
Thank you. I understand the theme now.

18:26.647 --> 18:28.816
<i>I have stopped.</i>

18:29.650 --> 18:31.068
<i>The scenery is melting.</i>

18:34.404 --> 18:39.576
<i>Everything except me is melting.
Even my opponent.</i>

18:40.327 --> 18:43.080
<i>He's coming at me even though he's melted.</i>

18:47.960 --> 18:49.086
<i>However,</i>

18:50.796 --> 18:52.089
<i>this melted scenery...</i>

18:53.298 --> 18:54.341
Okay?

18:55.843 --> 18:57.344
<i>It's not my first time.</i>

18:58.220 --> 19:00.472
BAILIN TEMPLE

19:04.059 --> 19:08.272
Retsu, you cannot avoid this. Don't move.

19:14.319 --> 19:15.612
Can you hear me?

19:16.446 --> 19:17.906
Effective, isn't it?

19:18.824 --> 19:22.619
You can't even see me properly.

19:23.620 --> 19:24.788
Stand up.

19:43.348 --> 19:44.683
This is tofu.

19:45.184 --> 19:48.729
Soaking in water,
it closely resembles the relationship

19:48.812 --> 19:51.773
between the human brain and skull.

20:02.117 --> 20:06.288
With the application of external impact,
it is quite easily destroyed.

20:07.206 --> 20:10.626
This is what the inside of your skull
was like earlier.

20:14.254 --> 20:16.632
You have mastered defenses.

20:17.132 --> 20:20.636
However, your defense could fail
and you'll be struck.

20:21.136 --> 20:23.472
As a consequence of lax training,

20:24.056 --> 20:26.767
one day you may be struck
with a full-force punch.

20:27.267 --> 20:29.269
In that case, what will you do?

20:40.530 --> 20:41.573
Do like this.

20:49.998 --> 20:53.377
<i>The damage I've taken...
I can't take anymore!</i>

20:54.836 --> 20:57.881
<i>The tofu is jiggling in the bowl.</i>

20:58.590 --> 21:01.051
<i>Until this jiggling stops,</i>

21:02.302 --> 21:06.473
<i>I cannot allow him
to hit me with his next punch.</i>

21:09.059 --> 21:11.061
<i>He's changed his form.</i>

21:11.561 --> 21:15.107
Retsu! Don't stand there! Circle around!

21:15.190 --> 21:16.733
<i>It doesn't matter.</i>

21:17.442 --> 21:19.027
<i>No matter how he changes,</i>

21:20.195 --> 21:22.489
<i>Smoking will just keep on following.</i>

21:22.572 --> 21:24.366
Circle around!

21:24.950 --> 21:28.370
<i>Smoking will just coil around you!</i>

21:33.458 --> 21:35.210
He... <i>spun</i> around.

21:46.221 --> 21:49.474
<i>Good. This is working. I'm recovering.</i>

21:50.726 --> 21:53.228
Well, he's really spinning around

21:53.312 --> 21:54.771
very nicely.

21:56.315 --> 21:57.524
<i>I knew that.</i>

21:59.359 --> 22:03.071
<i>I already knew
that you're a very talented fighter.</i>

22:05.073 --> 22:06.908
<i>But it doesn't change anything.</i>

22:06.992 --> 22:08.201
<i>I cannot change.</i>

22:09.494 --> 22:10.787
<i>This is all I know!</i>

22:11.663 --> 22:15.417
<i>Advance, chase, and coil around you.</i>

22:16.376 --> 22:18.670
<i>This is all I know!</i>
